    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 480,
    "bookid": 35,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Localization",
    "headingPosition": 6,
    "headingid": 437,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 66475,
        "bookId": 35,
        "chapterId": 16,
        "headingId": 437,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Mucous gland adenoma arises in the proximal airways, most commonly in the lobar or segmental bronchi. A few tumours with a similar histology have been reported in the lung periphery {23533890}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-11-11T10:52:43"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 481,
    "bookid": 35,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Clinical features",
    "headingPosition": 7,
    "headingid": 438,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 66476,
        "bookId": 35,
        "chapterId": 16,
        "headingId": 438,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Patients typically present with symptoms of obstruction, including cough, haemoptysis, dyspnoea, and recurrent pneumonia {7611535}. Imaging shows a well-defined mass {10524862}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-11-11T10:52:43"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 482,
    "bookid": 35,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Epidemiology",
    "headingPosition": 8,
    "headingid": 439,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 66477,
        "bookId": 35,
        "chapterId": 16,
        "headingId": 439,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Mucous gland adenoma is extremely rare. It has no sex predilection and has a wide age range (25&ndash;67&nbsp;years) {7611535}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-11-11T10:52:43"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 483,
    "bookid": 35,
